# BallSpot monorepo — root .gitignore

# Content backups must never be committed.
# They may contain database files, uploaded images, and user metadata.
backups/
howToStart.txt

# Environment files hold API keys and SMTP passwords, wherever they are placed.
.env
.env.*
!.env*.example

# Firebase/Google service-account PRIVATE keys (FCM V1 push key, Play upload
# key). They belong in EAS credentials only, never in git. google-services.json
# (the public Firebase client config) is not covered by this rule.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
